------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 dead ground
Text=<Ogres lie where they fell, and the stones that killed them lie on top of them. Nothing has come down to bury either. Whatever set these two against each other is not here to see it finished.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 titan ground
Text=<The rock here has been quarried by hand -- or by something with hands the size of a man. The pieces are stacked, not scattered. Something up here builds.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 cairn
Text=<A cairn at the top of the road, old enough that the stones have set into each other. Aragon behind you, and the counts of Toulouse ahead. Someone comes up here to keep it standing.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=4 cairn quiet
Text=<The cairn at the top of the road. Aragon behind, Toulouse ahead, and for the first time on this road the only thing moving is the wind.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
